{"id":"2B","title":"Faith and Belief","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2b","entries":[{"id":"2B.1","text":"All are required to have faith in God.","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":20,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":11,"verses":"22"},{"book":"John","chapter":14,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 20:20; Mark 11:22; John 14:1."},{"id":"2B.2","text":"Christians required to believe in Christ and on His name.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":6,"verses":"29"},{"book":"John","chapter":14,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":1,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":1,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":2,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":20,"verses":"21"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":17,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"John 6:29; John 14:1; Eph. 1:1; Col. 1:2; Gal. 2:20; Acts 20:21; 1 John 3:23, Rev. 17:14."},{"id":"2B.3","text":"Believe in Christ to do the work of God.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":6,"verses":"28-29"}],"citation":"John 6:28-29."},{"id":"2B.4","text":"Faith needed to open relationship with God.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":14,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":3,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":11,"verses":"6"}],"citation":"Acts 14:27; Rom. 5:2; Eph. 3:12; Heb. 11:6."},{"id":"2B.5","text":"He that is faithful in that which is least is faithful also in much.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"10-11"}],"citation":"Luke 16:10-11."},{"id":"2B.6","text":"We are to believe in the gospel and scriptures.","refs":[{"book":"Mark","chapter":1,"verses":"15"},{"book":"John","chapter":5,"verses":"46-47"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":24,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Philippians","chapter":1,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Mark 1:15; John 5:46-47; Acts 24:14; Phil. 1:27; Jude 1:3."},{"id":"2B.7","text":"We are to believe in what Moses and the prophets wrote.","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":20,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"29-31"},{"book":"John","chapter":5,"verses":"46-47"},{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 20:20; Luke 16:29-31; John 5:46-47; 2 Pet. 3:2."},{"id":"2B.8","text":"Faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the word of God.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":10,"verses":"16-17"}],"citation":"Rom. 10:16-17."},{"id":"2B.9","text":"Whoever believes in Christ shall not be condemned, but have eternal life.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":3,"verses":"15-18"},{"book":"John","chapter":6,"verses":"40,47"},{"book":"John","chapter":7,"verses":"38"},{"book":"John","chapter":11,"verses":"25-26"}],"citation":"John 3:15-18; John 6:40, 47; John 7:38; John 11:25-26."},{"id":"2B.10","text":"We are to put our trust in God as our help and shield (for he who trusts in the LORD, mercy shall surround him).","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":4,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":7,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":11,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":32,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":37,"verses":"3,5"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":56,"verses":"3,11"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":115,"verses":"9-11"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":1,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Psa. 4:5; Psa. 7:1; Psa. 11:1; Psa. 32:10; Psa. 37:3, 5; Psa. 56:3, 11 ; Psa. 115:9-11 ; 2 Cor. 1: 9."},{"id":"2B.11","text":"Blessed is the man who trusts in the LORD, and whose hope is in the LORD.","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Jer. 17:7."},{"id":"2B.12","text":"Watch, stand fast in the faith, be brave, be strong.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":16,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 16:13."},{"id":"2B.13","text":"Do not put your faith and trust in materialistic wealth and security, but in the living God.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":12,"verses":"16-30"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Luke 12:16-30; 1 Tim. 6:17."},{"id":"2B.14","text":"Your faith should not be in the wisdom of men butlin the power of God.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":2,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 2:5."},{"id":"2B.15","text":"He that believes in Christ, believes in God the Father.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":12,"verses":"44"}],"citation":"John 12:44."},{"id":"2B.16","text":"Those who believe in God should also be careful to maintain good works.","refs":[{"book":"Titus","chapter":3,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Titus 3:8."},{"id":"2B.17","text":"Trust in the LORD with all your heart, and lean not on your own understanding.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Prov. 3:5."},{"id":"2B.18","text":"Blessed are they that have not seen Christ, and yet have believed.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":20,"verses":"29"}],"citation":"John 20:29."},{"id":"2B.19","text":"Warnings against coming into unbelief.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":3,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":4,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Heb. 3:12; Heb. 4:11."},{"id":"2B.20","text":"Those who are guilty of unbelief have not the word of God in them and are not Christ's sheep.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":5,"verses":"38"},{"book":"John","chapter":10,"verses":"26"}],"citation":"John 5:38; John 10:26."},{"id":"2B.21","text":"Doubtfulness in the ways and power of God is forbidden.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":14,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":21,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":12,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":10,"verses":"20"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":2,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Matt. 14:31; Matt. 21:21; Luke 12:29; Acts 10:20; 1 Tim. 2:8."},{"id":"2B.22","text":"The power to do great things is given to those that have faith and doubt not.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":21,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":11,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":16,"verses":"17-18"}],"citation":"Matt. 21:21; Mark 11:23; Mark 16:17-18."},{"id":"2B.23","text":"We are not to believe every spirit but try them whether they are of God or not.","refs":[{"book":"1 John","chapter":4,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"1 John 4:1."},{"id":"2B.24","text":"It is better to have faith in the power of God than in the wisdom of men; it is better to trust the LORD than to put confidence in rulers.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":118,"verses":"8-9"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":2,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Psa. 118:8-9; 1 Cor. 2:5."},{"id":"2B.25","text":"Faith required for remission of sins.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":10,"verses":"43"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":3,"verses":"25"}],"citation":"Acts 10:43; Rom. 3:25."},{"id":"2B.26","text":"Through faith we establish the law.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":3,"verses":"31"}],"citation":"Rom. 3:31."},{"id":"2B.27","text":"Faith necessary in the Christian warfare.","refs":[{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":1,"verses":"18-19"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"1 Tim. 1:18-19; 1 Tim. 6:12."},{"id":"2B.28","text":"Whatever is not of faith is sin.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":16,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":14,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"John 16:9; Rom. 14:23."},{"id":"2B.29","text":"Faith without works is dead.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":2,"verses":"17-26"}],"citation":"James 2:17-26."},{"id":"2B.30","text":"Faith necessary in prayer.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":21,"verses":"22"},{"book":"James","chapter":1,"verses":"6-7"}],"citation":"Matt. 21:22; James 1:6-7."},{"id":"2B.31","text":"None of those who trust in the LORD shall be condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":34,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Psa. 34:22."}]}